# openvclient
===
 Open-source, GPU-rendered desktop client in Rust for databases and infrastructure: SQL (PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, SQLite, ClickHouse), MongoDB, Redis, Elasticsearch, Docker, SSH/SFTP and S3/Azure Blob. macOS, Windows, Linux. No telemetry..
